== If images appear blurry ... ==

If your sprites appear blurry in the Tuxemon game, their "bit depth" is probably too high. Open them in GIMP, navigate to Image > Mode > Indexed and click convert

See this image for the settings: 

[[File:Reduce_bit_depth.png]]

